# Cloudflare Pages. Static rules stay above dynamic ones. The /plans
# rules are exact paths only. Do not add a wildcard under /plans; that
# would also catch the agreement PDFs in this folder. The /admin/cars
# splat is a 200 rewrite to the one static shell, so the plate stays in
# the browser URL. public/_routes.json excludes /admin/cars/* so this
# rewrite runs. Portal Functions do not include these /plans paths.
/plans   /management   301
/plans/  /management/  301
/admin/cars/*  /admin/cars/  200
